---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Patrick Meenan" description="About Patrick Meenan - Web Performance Engineer">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <header class="mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-6 text-slate-900 dark:text-white">About Me</h1>
      <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 dark:from-blue-400 dark:to-indigo-400 rounded-full"></div>
    </header>

    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert prose-blue max-w-none text-lg">
      <p>
        Hi, I'm Patrick Meenan. I'm a developer on the Chrome team at Google working on web performance. 
      </p>
      
      <p>
        I created the <a href="https://www.webpagetest.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WebPageTest</a> performance testing tool and have spent my career focused on making the web faster. Over the years, I have worked on web performance at companies like Google, Meta, Cloudflare, Catchpoint, and AOL.
      </p>
      
      <p>
        I've been working on web performance since the dial-up days, and this blog mostly contains my random thoughts about web performance, development, browsers, or whatever else I might be thinking about at the time.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-bold flex items-center border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-2">
        How to Find Me
      </h2>
