      <div class="mt-12 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800/80 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 flex items-center">
          <span class="text-2xl mr-3">💬</span> Join the Conversation
        </h3>
        <p class="mb-4">
          Interested in web performance? I invite you to join the ongoing community discussions over on the Web Performance Slack channel!
        </p>
        <a href="https://webperformance.slack.com/" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-xl font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors shadow-sm">
          Join Web Performance Slack
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
